                <h1 id="bast">BAST</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="bast-GETapi-kantor-bast">Menampilkan daftar BAST dengan pagination dan filtering.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Endpoint ini mengembalikan daftar BAST yang dikelompokkan berdasarkan mitra_id,
bln_bayar, no_sk, no_bast, dan tgl_bast dengan informasi agregat.
Hanya pengguna yang sudah login yang dapat mengakses endpoint ini.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-kantor-bast">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/kantor/bast?per_page=16&amp;cursor=architecto&amp;sort_by=architecto&amp;sort_dir=architecto&amp;selected_bln=architecto" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/kantor/bast"
);

const params = {
    "per_page": "16",
    "cursor": "architecto",
    "sort_by": "architecto",
    "sort_dir": "architecto",
    "selected_bln": "architecto",
};
Object.keys(params)
    .forEach(key =&gt; url.searchParams.append(key, params[key]));

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};


fetch(url, {
    method: "GET",
    headers,
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

