                <h1 id="monitoring-kegiatan-config-data-detail">Monitoring Kegiatan - Config Data Detail</h1>

    

                                <h2 id="monitoring-kegiatan-config-data-detail-GETapi-kantor-kegiatan-monitoring-detil-configurations-available-fields">Get available fields based on foreign key.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Mengambil field yang tersedia berdasarkan kunci asing.
Endpoint ini mengembalikan konfigurasi detail berdasarkan nilai dan tipe kunci asing yang diberikan.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-kantor-kegiatan-monitoring-detil-configurations-available-fields">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/kantor/kegiatan/monitoring/detil-configurations/available-fields?foreign_key_value=architecto&amp;foreign_key_type=architecto" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"foreign_key_value\": \"architecto\",
    \"foreign_key_type\": \"kec_id\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/kantor/kegiatan/monitoring/detil-configurations/available-fields"
);

const params = {
    "foreign_key_value": "architecto",
    "foreign_key_type": "architecto",
};
Object.keys(params)
    .forEach(key =&gt; url.searchParams.append(key, params[key]));

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer Bearer {YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

let body = {
    "foreign_key_value": "architecto",
    "foreign_key_type": "kec_id"
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "GET",
    headers,
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

</span>

<span id="example-responses-GETapi-kantor-kegiatan-monitoring-detil-configurations-available-fields">
